  "notes": "Name as written in the announcement (Gemini-1.5-Pro-002); the Gemini app release notes write 1.5 Pro-002. The release notes say gemini-1.5-pro-latest pointed to this version from 2024-09-24. The announcement says the update builds on the experimental releases of the preceding weeks (gemini-1.5-pro-exp-0801 and gemini-1.5-pro-exp-0827 in the release notes, kept as candidate aliases). Input modalities are not restated in the -002 sources, so inputModalities is left out; see google.gemini-1-5-pro. No deprecation announcement date was found in live sources."
